From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:03:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ios/audio: add DM_AUDIO_MIX audio session mixing option

Keep AVAudioSessionCategoryPlayback ignoring the silent switch unchanged and pass AVAudioSessionCategoryOptionMixWithOthers only when DM_AUDIO_MIX is truthy, explicitly clearing options to 0 when off for shared-shell isolation.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Let iOS players mix game audio with other apps using AVAudioSessionCategoryOptionMixWithOthers while keeping playback active on silent
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#1269
